_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{{sin}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x=$" 13194139535669 true] [17592186360229 1113 #uuid "24044e3f-134c-5299-af89-c5c8b8e789d5" 13194139535669 true] [17592186360229 1145 "We can write the integral as\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{{sin}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x={\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}\\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe then use the fact that $\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}=\\operatorname{csc}⁡x$ and $\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}=\\operatorname{cot}⁡x$ to express this as\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}\\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\,{|}_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2} \\\\  & =-[\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})-\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4})] \\\\  & =-[1-\\sqrt{2}] \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2}-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535669 true] [17592186360230 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360231 13194139535669 true] [17592186360230 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360232 13194139535669 true] [17592186360230 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360233 13194139535669 true] [17592186360230 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360234 13194139535669 true] [17592186360230 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360235 13194139535669 true] [17592186360230 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535669 true] [17592186360230 1041 "selection" 13194139535669 true] [17592186360230 1104 #edb/ref 17592186360232 13194139535669 true] [17592186360230 1110 #uuid "d0d4d6e6-f407-5ace-8a39-708a1c981667" 13194139535669 true] [17592186360231 1034 "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}-2}{3}" 13194139535669 true] [17592186360231 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535669 true] [17592186360231 1111 #uu